      "Port this ON CONFLICT DO UPDATE to Azure SQL Database",
      "Review this upsert stored procedure before it goes to production"
    ],
    "implicit": [
      "we have two rows with the same key and nothing in the application inserts twice",
      "this worked in testing and now we get violation of PRIMARY KEY constraint under load",
      "the MERGE statement attempted to UPDATE or DELETE the same row more than once",
      "my sync job deleted rows that were not in the batch",
      "make this insert idempotent so retries do not create a second row",
      "why is my upsert deadlocking now that we run it from several workers",
      "should I wrap the check and the insert in a transaction",
      "a MERGE statement must be terminated by a semi-colon"
    ],
